The KN95 is an advanced protective mask that is capable of filtering out up to 95% of non-oily particles in the air. This includes dust and a number of other air-borne substances.
The KN95 filters out a minimum of 95% of particles that fall in the range of 0.3 microns and above. The manufacturer for the N95 mask has documented through their newsroom that the KN95 mask is a great alternative.
Next: Face mask KN95 with valve
Zhong said:”I think we will be able to eradicate the disease, but basically can be controlled. Although it is difficult to predict,”a year later the situation will be better than now”.
Can it prevent virus
How often is the KN95 mask replaced?
Under normal circumstances, KN95 standard masks can be used for 3 days without epidemic situation. However, it is more severe to go to the new type of pneumonia.
For the front-line doctors in hospitals, they basically use medical surgical masks, goggles and protective clothing, so as to do basic safety protection. Medical surgical masks are basically worn once, and they will be replaced when they are used next time.
Bester suggests that you can replace one in 8 hours. Generally, if you want to go out for a long time and enter crowded places, it is almost as good to prepare two masks a day.
KN95 masks are not recommended to be reused. One is that it is not easy to disinfect yourself, which may also lead to safety hazards due to inadequate disinfection.
Bottle technology mask reminds KN95 that it is better not to wash the mask with water. When selecting respirators to prevent particulate matter (such as dust, smoke, fog and pathogenic microorganisms from various sources, including PM2.5), it is necessary to select a respirator that meets Chinese or international standards to achieve basic filtration efficiency.
Medical surgical mask is in line with the national standard GB19083-2010 mandatory standard, filtration efficiency is greater than 95% of non oily particles test, and meets the blood penetration test.
It meets the mandatory standard of GB2626-2006, and the filtration efficiency of non oily particles is more than 95% Can N95 masks be worn for a long time?
N95 mask belongs to industrial dustproof mask, which has good airtightness and is easy to cause people to have poor breathing and hypoxia. If it is haze weather, citizens do not need to wear N95 masks.
matters needing attention:
More beautiful design style and multi-layer material protection, which can filter particles efficiently and stimulate peculiar smell, dust, bacteria and viruses.
The doctor says: COVID – 19 of the lung damage is more serious than smoking
A trauma surgeon since march to treat the patients with thousands of coronavirus, she warned that a terrible hangover could affect many survivors of COVID - 19.
Even after eliminating infection without symptoms, lung may need longer time to heal.
Kendall, explained Dr Since March 2020, she treated thousands of patients, patients with COVID - 19 severe chest X-ray every time. Those asymptomatic COVID - 19 cases showed that 70% to 80% all have serious X ray.
