According to Russian media reports, the United States admitted for the first time that American military athletes had suspected COVID-19 symptoms during the Wuhan Military Games in 2019.
It is worth noting that the United States, as a global military power, did not even win a gold medal at the Wuhan Military Games in 2019, and the medal list also ranked 35th among the 56 countries that won awards, which is very confusing. This makes people wonder whether the players who came to Wuhan Military Games had symptoms such as physical discomfort before the competition.
