Even more you who likes to travel abroad. "To which I replied: yes you can, which leads us to the second tip:
And here I "teach" how you can parcel out the trip and even pay for it!
The parcel of the trip to which I refer, would be to divide the costs of the trip into groups of costs. Experience shows me that the main types are:
Accommodation (hotels, hostel, places you will be staying).
Separating the groups of expenses you can pay the view each one of them, ask about a discount, and parcel out the costs of the trip without using the installment of the credit card.
Of course these costs are not covered the whole list, they are only those that are repeated in almost every trip. The goal is to show that you can already leave them paid and so make a trip without having to pay everything on time.
But since I think that you, like me, do not have a million dollars to invest and take out the 5.000,00 liquids a month, the suggestion is to apply a proportional amount.
