First trip to Lithuania - Vilnius - Seeing good friends Post navigation
What impressed me the most?
(Oh and also Minsk cheese biscuits.) Thanks for caring, you really know how to surprise people!
I got into debt. Then put it in the account of friendship.
Kate, just keep being that brilliant person you already are and that your family has many blessings ahead!
This feeling of meeting good friends is so good, especially those who live far away, but with whom we have not lost contact. Is not it?
And this was the best bike rack decoration I've ever seen. They said that at the time the decoration was made for the promotion of the film: “Kong the island of the skull”, but it was so good that they left it there for a longer time, I don't know if it continues today, but it was until the time I went (2019 ).
Public transport has several options and costs only 1,00 Euro to get around. (2019 data).
Now if you want to enter the 600-year-old tower that today functions as a historical museum, you must pay 5 euros (2019). They say that the view from the top of the tower is fantastic, but I was already satisfied with the base.
Today they are mainly used as venues for presentations, conferences and theater, since Vilnius is the capital of a country and no more than a Grand Duchy. Even so, the external facades are kept, and a museum (even has the crown of the Duke who became King).
On its banks it is written on one side with flowers: "I love you" And on the other side of the river there is the answer: "I love you too". It is as if the message of love could reach all the inhabitants, as well as the water that reaches their homes.
