If people imagine themselves rich, regardless of the amount of money they have, chances are they will be healthy and strong and live an abundant life.
All that we are searching for in life is already present within ourselves.
I challenge you to stretch your mind to the possibility of accomplishment beyond your present aspirations.
How would you feel if you found the cure for AIDS or cancer?
The reality is that until everyone on the planet imagines a world of health and vitality for all, there will always be disease and woe.
