Calm is similar to Headspace in its setup: here, the free element is a seven-day course of guided-meditation exercises, while the monthly subscription costs £7.99 and the yearly option £29.99 – the latter is thus a pretty good deal.
There are also individual sessions lasting between two and 20 minutes, and “unguided” sessions using music and nature sounds.
