People are like Frog B in general.
Tomorrow, Patrick walks up to her and told her he hates her.
The next day, she learned that Kim and John also abhors her.
We learn our lessons when we experience pain.
When do we realize that we need to change diets?
When do we realize that we need to stop smoking?
When do we pray and ask for help?
The only time most of us ever learn about unlocking our self improvement power is when the whole world is crashing and falling apart.
But change becomes more painful when we ignore it.
At one point or another, we are all going to experience different turning points in our life ñ and we are all going to eventually unlock our self improvement power not because the world says so, not because our friends are nagging us, but because we realized its for our own good.
Now, you donít have to feel a tremendous heat before realizing the need for self improvement.
It is such a poor excuse for people who fear and resist change.
Jen repeatedly tells everyone that she doesnít have the guts to be around groups of people.
Over the years, that is what Jen believes.
And what happens?
Jen didnít only believed in her story, she lived it.
Instead of having her story post around her face for everyone to remember, she has to have the spirit and show people ìI am an important person and I should be treated accordingly!î Self improvement may not be everybodyís favorite word, but if we look at things in a different point of view, we might have greater chances of enjoying the whole process instead of counting the days until we are fully improved.
