Research, however, seems to indicate that after some minimum quantity, the quality of sleep is more important for normal brain function.
There are enough other reasons to take a walk anyhow.
Three deep breaths through your nose is like a mini-meditation.
Sometimes a phone call you need to make quietly bothers you all day, just below consciousness.
